#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube5.5.0"
msgid "The followers of Zinglon have announced that they have finally settled their centuries old vendetta against the followers of  Daizan, a less popular but still proactive radical group who attended the militarist school of Chesapeake Academy, Fauchi sector on Tyrian."
msgstr ""

#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube5.5.6"
msgid "The Academy, nestled in the forests of Severnai Park, has been a religious teaching school for many distinguished literary scholars on revealed religion, but recently has fallen into  disrepute because of the actions of the Zinglon and Daizan cults. The difficulties began when two students maliciously broke the arm and leg of a Zinglon research student during a sports tournament."
msgstr ""

